---LINES
---SCREEN
=video attributes setup

  Settings mode (color,monochrome,...) may be changed pressing .'0 .'1 .'2

  .:SP... or key .:DE... changes an attribute value in set "w" or "r"

  .'w or .'o selects /set "w"/		.:KI... switches keyboard input
  .'r or .'i selects /set "r"/		 between /set "w"/ or /set "r"/

* /set "w"/ (write, output) is used when line is shown
* /set "r"/ (read, input) is used when line is pointed by cursor (active)

." logical type of *lines* : "....................
    CMD - initial text mode (restored on exit)
    TXT - comment and labels before active lines
    HDR - header
    VAR - editable text or number (variables)
    ALT - selector or alterator
    MSE - menu selection point
    ERR - error message text
    ATT - warning or attention message

---END
* line is a thing which links data and representation in variety of aspects
